"<p>The Nitrobase control panel generates an OpenAPI 3.0 specification available at:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-text\"><span class=\"line\"><span>/api/v1/openapi.json</span></span></code></pre>\n<p>You can import this JSON file into Postman, Insomnia, or code-generation tools like <code>openapi-typescript</code> to generate fully-typed SDK clients.</p>"